{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53908","headline":"宿云门香阁院 · 李褒","name":"宿云门香阁院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香阁无尘雪後天，石盆如月贮寒泉。\n高僧洗足南轩罢，还枕蒲团就日眠。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李褒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}